OL,3,GNEWSAFirst exhibition announced for
OL,4,Arelocated gallery
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe first exhibition of an art gallery
OL,7,Fforced to move to new premises has been
OL,8,Fannounced.
OL,10,FThe Northern Gallery for Contemporary
OL,11,FArt (NGCA) is moving to the Culture
OL,12,FHouse in Sunderland on 12 September,
OL,13,Fopening with an exhibition on local
OL,14,Fartist Audrey Amiss.
OL,16,FThe University of Sunderland, which
OL,17,Fruns the gallery, said Kitchen Sink
OL,18,FRealism would feature previously unseen
OL,19,Fpaintings and drawings, as well as
OL,20,Farchival material by the late
OL,21,FSunderland-born artist.
OL,23,APub: 25-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,400,390,260,160,0,100
