OL,3,GNEWSAFirst exhibition announced for
OL,4,Arelocated gallery
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe gallery was previously housed at
OL,7,Fthe National Glass Centre, which shut
OL,8,Fin July after the university said it
OL,9,Fcould not afford building repairs.
